WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,580
The Northern Barbarians shouldn't be so bold

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,890
Omae's national power prevailed

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,490
If the Northern Barbarians really start a war

4
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,290
It's like hitting an egg against a stone

5
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,560
But if there is no war

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:15,600
What is the purpose of this attack? Li Dao

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,240
What do you think about this?

8
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:19,530
You are the great commander

9
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,710
Just help me analyze it

10
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,540
Afterwards, relying on today's military exploits

11
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:31,260
I guarantee you a centurion. How to determine the position of the centurion?

12
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,790
If I don't do it for you

13
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:35,950
I give you my position as commander-in-chief

14
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:37,350
if you want to do it for me

15
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,270
I don't mind either

16
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,220
Hurry up and help me analyze it

17
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:46,530
This is no small matter. Come on in and talk about it.
